{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/14/6245614/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこーーーー(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日ちはると飛鳥とまあやと夜ご飯食べに行ったんよん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみがオススメの渋谷にあるピザ屋さん、ナポリスにみんなで行ったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/14/6245614/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リーズナブルでしかも美味しいのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/14/6245614/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも行ってみてくれっとおっとっけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでな～今日は、ガールポップの撮影がありましたとてんてんとてん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか5才の頃に戻った気分だったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/14/6245614/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷりぷり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーきゃぴきゃぴと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっと、あーきゃぴきゃぴと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オンエアは4月6日よ観てねーと❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/14/6245614/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんで失礼します\nっと眉毛じゃっかし短いんですねーわたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや姫と撮ったんでね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハートという名のブレインクハート。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハートとといえば今日はホワイトデーじゃないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、みんなーあみに何かくれてみなぁ～( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、てか今気づいたけど今日載せてる写真全部同じ手のポーズしてるねんけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返す！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの生写真を\nめっちゃ集めてる女の子ってどう思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーりゃあなんかモテ子になった気分になるさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫？ブスなのばっかじゃない？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高３になったら受験勉強しなきゃいけなくて５thの関東でやる個別が終わったら\nしばらくあみに会いに行けなくなります。\n受験終わったら必ず会いに行くけどその頃まで私のこと覚えててくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に覚えときたいけど、\nあんまり長い期間だったらちょっとこわいな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからなるべく頑張って早く会いにきてね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみが好きな歌手って誰ですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BIGBANG\nTーARA\nセカイノオワリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き毎日聞いてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/03/14/6245614/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族になってもいいですか?\n(自称より、認められたほうがうれしいんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんさーー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたは私が認めた立派なあみあみ族だよ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オレ握手会んときとかでもよく寝坊しちゃうんだけど早起きできるコツとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなの私のことを思えば3.2.1で起きられるでしょ？？？あみを待たせる気ー？？(￣(工)￣)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族に入りたいんですけど入ってもいいですかー？"}